      ],
      "title": "Character Sheet x5",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.37.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit ref 1 directly.\n\nPreserve ref 1's exact canvas, composition, layout, subject positions, poses, camera angles, crops, framing, relative sizes, spacing and view directions.\n\nReplace ALL representations of the mannequin in ref 1 with the same woman from ref 2.\n\nIMPORTANT: this includes the LARGE CROPPED HEAD-AND-UPPER-BODY MANNEQUIN on the far left. Replace that large mannequin with a large cropped close-up of the woman from ref 2, occupying exactly the same area, scale, crop and position as the mannequin it replaces.\n\nReplace the four full-body mannequin views with the same woman from ref 2 while preserving each existing pose, orientation, size and position.\n\nUse ref 2 for the woman's identity, face, hair, body proportions and clothing. Infer the required side and back appearances naturally from ref 2.\n\nChange ONLY the mannequin/character content.\n\nDo not leave any mannequin visible.\nDo not shrink the large left close-up into a full-body view.\nDo not make all five representations the same size.\nDo not redesign or reconstruct the character-sheet layout.\nDo not add, remove, move, resize or rearrange any views.\n\nThe final image must retain ref 1's original asymmetric layout: one LARGE cropped close-up on the far left plus the existing smaller full-body views."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6127,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
        3812.453229203778,
        9141.732421564004
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        200
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
